  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "键与唯一约束",
      "items": [
        "PK/FK/UK 徽标出自 SQL 原文；复合唯一键的成员列不标 UK，完整键见下。",
        "uk_tenant_username(tenant_id, username)、uk_daily_link_date(link_id, stat_date)（幂等落桶承重墙）、uk_link_variant(link_id, variant_key)。",
        "uk_dim_link_date_value(link_id, stat_date, dim_type, dim_value)、uk_webhook_endpoint_event(endpoint_id, event_id)（投递幂等兜底）、uk_agg_window_link(endpoint_id, window_start, link_id)。",
        "uk_webhook_tenant(tenant_id) 为单列唯一：每租户仅一个 Webhook 端点。"
      ]
